Implementation-Title: vendor
Component-Catalogue: true

Name: com/vendor/MarketData.class
Component: true
Provides: mid, depth, vol, ewma
Constructor: ()
Consumes: Tick, Config[volFactor]
Description: mid, depth, volatility and a smoothed mid

Name: com/vendor/Pricing.class
Component: true
Provides: adjusted, spread
Requires: MarketData
Constructor: (MarketData)
Consumes: Tick, Rate
Description: the adjusted price and the spread

Name: com/vendor/Liquidity.class
Component: true
Provides: book, score
Requires: MarketData, Pricing
Constructor: (MarketData, Pricing)
Consumes: Tick
Description: book depth and a liquidity score

Name: com/vendor/Risk.class
Component: true
Provides: notional, exposure, var, streak
Requires: MarketData, Liquidity
Constructor: (MarketData, Liquidity)
Consumes: Tick, Trade, Rate
Reads: MarketData.mid, MarketData.vol, Liquidity.score
Description: exposure, VaR and the breach streak; limitBreached() is a query, not a signal
Note: recomputes ONLY on the events it consumes. It does not consume Config.

Name: com/vendor/Capital.class
Component: true
Provides: charge, buffer, fee, breachCount, alertCount
Requires: Risk
Constructor: (Risk)
Consumes: Tick, Trade, Rate, Config[chargePct]
Reads: Risk.exposure, Risk.var, Risk.limitBreached
Description: capital charge, buffer, fee, breach alerting and the reported counts
Note: publishes alerts itself to the AlertSink you install; do not publish alerts yourself
